  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N329f0cfbcccb4d2a8a84b05720808f87">
    <skos:note>BEST (FDA/NIH). Delivered as an NIH Bookshelf resource; defines biomarker categories (molecular, histologic, radiographic, physiologic) but has no individual resolvable per-term URIs, so it is a reference source only, not an instance-URL source. Retained in PGO V2.0 as a documented stub: potentially a high-value instance-URL source for biomarkers if a machine-readable (RDF/database) version is or becomes available. Asiyah Yu Lin to follow up with FDA/NIH on whether BEST could be offered as a database/RDF (no response yet as of 2026-10-19)</skos:note>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://rdfs.org/ns/void#Dataset"/>
