    <dcterms:description xml:lang="en">MicroRNA target of miravirsen (anti-miR-122 LNA antisense oligonucleotide for HCV treatment); first ncRNA drug target to reach Phase II clinical trials; illustrates the RNA/ncRNA molecular target class</dcterms:description>
